cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper and the three source datasets."
title: "ARMD cross-system transferability audit — analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline for a cross-system transferability audit of a Pseudomonas
  aeruginosa antimicrobial-susceptibility prediction model trained at Mass
  General Brigham and evaluated at Stanford Health Care and UT Southwestern
  Medical Center, including shift-attribution diagnostics, evidence-drift
  analysis, data-alignment sensitivity analyses and the figure scripts.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-22"
license: MIT
# TODO: add co-author Huang Yinong (affiliation to confirm) — LICENSE names two
# copyright holders, so this author list is currently incomplete
authors:
