    title: "Antibiotic Resistance Microbiology Dataset Mass General Brigham (ARMD-MGB)"
    doi: "10.13026/2r5k-b955"
    notes: "PhysioNet; credentialed access under Credentialed Health Data License 1.5.0"
  - type: dataset
